From 82b463a10a0f271a4cac33cc3197fbb2d72a65c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel <kuboloko.info@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:29:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(cotl): add routed pages under
 /projetos/children-of-the-lance

Six nested routes, following the site's file-based routing convention:

- route.tsx    layout wrapper (loads the two display fonts, renders the
               shared navbar + footer); scopes noindex to the subsection
- index.tsx    /projetos/children-of-the-lance          (home / hero)
- historia.tsx /projetos/children-of-the-lance/historia  (about the story)
- personagens  /projetos/children-of-the-lance/personagens (characters)
- conflito.tsx /projetos/children-of-the-lance/conflito  (the Silver Child)
- ler.tsx      /projetos/children-of-the-lance/ler       (read-the-story link)
- creditos.tsx /projetos/children-of-the-lance/creditos  (full disclaimer)

Every page sets its own title + description and robots: noindex. No
changes to __root.tsx, the global nav, i18n, vite.config or build
scripts. routeTree.gen.ts is regenerated by the router plugin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
